Day 03 - Ansible, Terraform & Kubernetes Basic

* Ansible - Install Apache and start service
  - name: Install and Start Apache
   host: all
   become: yes
   tasks:
    
   -name: Install apache
   yum:
   name: httpd
   state: present


   -name: Start apache
   service:
   name: httpd
    state: started
    enabled: yes
  

